meta {
  name: Librix API
}

auth {
  mode: none
}

docs {
  Librix API collection.

  Start the API with `make run` (listens on :3000) and select the
  `local` environment before sending requests.

  Variables used by the requests:
    baseUrl  - API origin (default http://localhost:3000)
    bookId   - id of an existing book
    userId   - id of an existing user
    days     - loan length in days (0 = server default of 14)
}
